20260517180758 Updated `convert_media.py` to support your SendTo workflow plus ZID-based duplicate handling. What changed in [convert_media.py](u:\voothi\20241213164711-convert-media\convert_media.py): - Added `--install-sendto` to create a Windows SendTo shortcut (`FFmpeg Convert Media`). - Added `--sendto` mode so Explorer-selected files are passed and converted in one run. - Added duplicate strategy: - Normal target: `\converted\.mp4` - If duplicate exists: `\converted\\.mp4` - If still duplicate in same ZID folder: `-2.mp4`, `-3.mp4`, etc. - Kept backward compatibility for legacy mode: - `python convert_media.py [ffmpeg_path]` Validation: - `python -m py_compile convert_media.py` passed. How to enable SendTo: 1. `python convert_media.py --install-sendto --ffmpeg-path "C:\ffmpeg\bin\ffmpeg.exe"` 2. In Explorer: select files -> right click -> `Send to` -> `FFmpeg Convert Media`.


